  "title": "Lemon Chewy Crisps",
  "description": "Great fresh lemon taste in a chewy little cookie with a nice crisp brown edge. If you don&#39;t have the almonds, you can substitute 1/4 cup additional sugar instead.",
  "authors": [
    "Jennifer Lipka"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-02-22T19:53:02-05:00",
